Package: coloclize
Title: Utility Functions For Colocalization Analyses
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Sounkou Mahamane", family = "Toure" ,  email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package provides utility functions to facilitate colocalization analyses between GWAS and QTL summary statistics. It
    includes utilities for data formating and harmonization, LD matrix computation, and visualization of colocalization results.
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
